{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49858","headline":"南乡子 二 · 冯延巳","name":"南乡子 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细雨泣秋风，金凤花[残]满地红。\n闲[蹙]黛眉慵不语，情绪，寂寞相思知几许。\n玉枕拥孤衾，挹恨还闻岁月深。\n帘卷曲房谁共醉，顦顇，惆怅秦楼弹粉泪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}